Package: scalapack-gnu15-mvapich2-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: ohpc-filesystem, gnu15-compilers-ohpc (>= 14.1.0), mvapich2-gnu15-ohpc, openblas-gnu15-ohpc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: A subset of LAPACK routines redesigned for heterogeneous computing (gnu15 + mvapich2, OpenHPC)
 The ScaLAPACK (or Scalable LAPACK) library includes a subset of LAPACK
 routines redesigned for distributed memory MIMD parallel computers.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and mvapich2 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
